raw.text:
@abhijeet_dipke Dipke,

​Are you attempting to educate the business community of Delhi and the nation? The public remembers the previous protests and the disruptions that followed.
​True advocacy requires responsibility, not chaotic protests that harm public order and local businesses. Exercise caution before lost public goodwill turns into widespread opposition.

